Package: algorithmviewer
Title: Algorithm Viewer - Shiny Application for Visualizing Prediction Algorithms
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
  person(given = "Martin", 
         family = "Wellman",
         role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
         email = "mwellman@ohri.ca")
  )
Description: A Shiny web application for visualizing prediction algorithms,
    including odds ratio and predicted risk curves. Allows users to upload
    algorithm configurations, select models, adjust reference groups, and
    interactively explore predictor relationships.
